OL,3,GNEWSADigital instruments help pupils
OL,4,Areach Royal Albert Hall
OL,5,
OL,6,FPupils from a special needs school are
OL,7,Fpreparing to perform at the Royal
OL,8,FAlbert Hall - with a digital instrument
OL,9,Fon an iPad that some children will play
OL,10,Fwith their eyes.
OL,12,FChildren from Chadsgrove School in
OL,13,FBromsgrove will follow in the footsteps
OL,14,Fof The Beatles and Adele in performing
OL,15,Fat the prestigious London concert hall
OL,16,Fas part of the annual show Music for
OL,17,FYouth.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,357,350,200,160,0,100
