OL,3,GNEWSADigital instruments help pupils
OL,4,Areach Royal Albert Hall
OL,5,
OL,6,FSeveral of them will play Clarion, an
OL,7,Felectronic instrument that is designed
OL,8,Fspecifically for disabled musicians and
OL,9,Fcan be played using any part of the
OL,10,Fbody, which is downloaded onto tablets
OL,11,Fand laptops.
OL,13,FMusic teacher Steph Wellings said:
OL,14,F"It's a total gamechanger for music
OL,15,Fmaking in a special school. It's just
OL,16,Fbeen amazing."
